Privacy Policy for Feline Fitness
Last Updated: October 10, 2025

Your privacy is important to us. This policy explains how the Feline Fitness application handles information.

Information We Use

Feline Fitness is designed to operate without collecting, storing, or transmitting any of your personal information. We believe in privacy by design.

Bluetooth & Location Permissions

To function, the app requires permission to access your device's Bluetooth and Location services. This is used exclusively for the following purposes:

Bluetooth: To scan for, connect to, and communicate with the Feline Fitness cat toy.

Location: On some operating systems, location permission is required to perform Bluetooth scans for nearby devices.

This data is processed locally on your device to enable the app's core functionality and is never sent to us or any third party.

Data Storage

The app stores a custom name you assign to your toy. This name is saved locally on your device using its preferences and is not shared or uploaded anywhere.

Changes to This Policy

We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page.

